WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:06.765
"Oh no," Roxy said. "One of the knights is probably Sir Dillard."

2
00:00:06.766 --> 00:00:10.774
"Who is Sir Dillard?" Mayor Bloom asked.

3
00:00:10.775 --> 00:00:14.219
"A knight at the Kingdom Festival," Roxy said.

4
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.859
"He got really angry when someone's phone beeped.

5
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:24.357
It interrupted the show. Don't worry, Mayor. I'll handle it!"

6
00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:27.456
Sir Dillard stood on the building's roof and grinned.

7
00:00:27.457 --> 00:00:31.336
His workers stacked heavy stone blocks around the roof's edge.

8
00:00:31.337 --> 00:00:34.160
Soon the building would look like a castle!

9
00:00:34.161 --> 00:00:36.773
"Excellent work!" Sir Dillard said.

10
00:00:36.774 --> 00:00:41.282
"When this is done, start digging a moat around the entire building."

11
00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:44.316
He turned to Lady Jane. "We might be attacked.

12
00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:47.619
I want archers posted all along the roof."

13
00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:50.883
"Yes, sir!" Lady Jane hurried away.

14
00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.587
Sir Dillard grinned again.

15
00:00:52.588 --> 00:00:56.040
"Finally, my queen will have a real castle!

16
00:00:56.041 --> 00:01:00.522
And Metro City will be her kingdom!"

17
00:01:00.523 --> 00:01:03.150
*** Roxy arrived at the technology hub

18
00:01:03.151 --> 00:01:07.446
building. Broken computers, wires, and other electronics lay

19
00:01:07.447 --> 00:01:10.532
everywhere. She saw big stone blocks on the

20
00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:16.700
roof. Roxy gasped. "They're turning the technology hub building into a

21
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:20.610
castle!" Several police cars were parked across the

22
00:01:20.611 --> 00:01:24.120
street. Roxy saw Detective Smith talking to a

23
00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:29.542
man. She flew down. "Hey, Detective . . . I mean, Your

24
00:01:29.543 --> 00:01:34.427
Majesty." Detective Smith frowned. "Very funny, Rocket

25
00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:37.091
Girl." "Don't make jokes!" the man said.

26
00:01:37.092 --> 00:01:40.185
"Those knights took over the Meta Snack office!"

27
00:01:40.186 --> 00:01:44.761
Detective Smith took out his notebook. "What's Meta Snack?"

28
00:01:44.762 --> 00:01:47.344
"It's my company," the man said.

29
00:01:47.345 --> 00:01:51.884
"I make an app. It tells people what snacks they will like."

30
00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:56.585
Detective Smith raised an eyebrow. "People already know what snacks they like."

31
00:01:56.586 --> 00:02:00.663
"Yeah," Roxy said. "Who needs an app for that?"

32
00:02:00.664 --> 00:02:04.465
The man rolled his eyes. "But people make mistakes.

33
00:02:04.466 --> 00:02:07.032
My computer code is perfect."

34
00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:12.082
"Okay," Detective Smith said. "What can you tell us about the knights?"

35
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.766
"The leader was called Sir Dillard," the man said.

36
00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:22.892
"I knew it!" Roxy said. "He was at the Kingdom Festival. I'll stop him."

37
00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:29.866
Roxy stepped into the street. "Sir Dillard! Come out of that building right now!"

38
00:02:29.867 --> 00:02:32.750
Sir Dillard looked down from the building's roof.

39
00:02:32.751 --> 00:02:37.195
"Rocket Girl! Don't even think about attacking my castle!"

40
00:02:37.196 --> 00:02:41.122
"It's not a castle, Sir Dillard," Roxy said.

41
00:02:41.123 --> 00:02:47.258
"It's the building for Metro City's new technology hub. You need to leave now!"

42
00:02:47.259 --> 00:02:53.049
"I will never leave! And I will never surrender! I fight for the queen!"

43
00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:57.794
Sir Dillard looked over his shoulder. "Archers, fire!"

44
00:02:57.795 --> 00:03:01.523
Archers suddenly appeared along the roof's edge. Whoosh!

45
00:03:01.524 --> 00:03:06.938
Roxy gasped as dozens of arrows shot down toward her!

